/* ABL class */
USING Progress.Lang.*.

CLASS samples.MyClass:

  DEFINE PUBLIC PROPERTY Name AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO
    GET.
    SET.

  CONSTRUCTOR PUBLIC MyClass(INPUT pcName AS CHARACTER):
    THIS-OBJECT:Name = pcName.
  END CONSTRUCTOR.

  METHOD PUBLIC CHARACTER ToString():
    RETURN THIS-OBJECT:Name.
  END METHOD.

END CLASS.
